section.animate-in.space-y-4
	a.nav-link.text-sm.inline-flex.items-center.gap-1(href="/examples") ← examples
	h1.text-5xl.font-bold.tracking-tight.leading-none
		GradientText TRON payloads
	p.text-lg.max-w-prose.leading-relaxed(class="text-fg-muted")
		| Where lists get big, the page stops carrying them: a
		code route()
		| serves them, content-negotiated between JSON and
		code application/tron
		| , and the browser (or an agent) pulls exactly the slice it needs.

	Banner(variant="info" icon="lucide:database")
		| Every page here reads the same D1 table as the Notes example. Empty table? Use “Seed 500 notes” on the table page first.

section.animate-in-delayed.pt-12
	.grid.gap-3(class="sm:grid-cols-2")
		Card(href="/examples/tron/table")
			.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-3.mb-2
				h2.font-semibold.text-lg Server-paged table
				span.text-xs.font-mono.shrink-0.mt-1(class="text-fg-subtle") schema mode
			p.text-sm.leading-relaxed(class="text-fg-muted") DataTable + Pagination driven by useList() over GET /api/notes?page&sort&q. Rows travel as #notes.v1 positional arrays.
		Card(href="/examples/tron/picker")
			.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-3.mb-2
				h2.font-semibold.text-lg Remote pickers
				span.text-xs.font-mono.shrink-0.mt-1(class="text-fg-subtle") source
			p.text-sm.leading-relaxed(class="text-fg-muted") Autocomplete and MultiSelect with a debounced source() over GET /api/notes/search — the option set never ships with the page.
		Card(href="/examples/tron/stats")
			.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-3.mb-2
				h2.font-semibold.text-lg Columnar stats
				span.text-xs.font-mono.shrink-0.mt-1(class="text-fg-subtle") Float64Array
			p.text-sm.leading-relaxed(class="text-fg-muted") A numeric table decoded with api.tape() into a flat tape — no row objects — and charted. Cached at the edge for 30 s.
		Card(href="/examples/tron/form")
			.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-3.mb-2
				h2.font-semibold.text-lg API-mode form
				span.text-xs.font-mono.shrink-0.mt-1(class="text-fg-subtle") submit
			p.text-sm.leading-relaxed(class="text-fg-muted") The same Form / Field components, posting TRON to POST /api/notes instead of a form action; 400 issues land on the right Field.
		Card(href="/examples/tron/agent")
			.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-3.mb-2
				h2.font-semibold.text-lg Agent-facing export
				span.text-xs.font-mono.shrink-0.mt-1(class="text-fg-subtle") self-describing
			p.text-sm.leading-relaxed(class="text-fg-muted") GET /api/notes/export as JSON and as TRON side by side: bytes, rough tokens, and the edge-cache / ETag headers a Worker adds.
